# Per-Dockerfile ignore for the all-in-one image (BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to the root .dockerignore). Allowlist: the Rust workspace, mm-switch, the
# web workspace and the image's own files. Everything else stays out of the context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates
# crates/mm-api include_str!s mm-core/data/reserved_usernames.json.
!mm-core/data
!services/mm-switch
!web/package.json
!web/package-lock.json
!web/tsconfig.base.json
!web/packages
!infra/docker/allinone

# Build output and local leftovers inside the re-included trees.
**/target
**/.DS_Store
services/mm-switch/mm-switch
services/mm-switch/local
web/**/node_modules
web/**/dist
web/**/.turbo
web/**/*.tsbuildinfo
